    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but they wouldn't be \"seeing the real me\" if i'm not here. if i'm gone, they can just hold onto the dream of who i was supposed to be. right now, i'm just a constant reminder of how much they've lost because of my failures. wouldn't it be more dignified for our family if the failure just... stopped being a problem? if the stain was just gone?",
